// Plain-English input action mapping: one action meaning, many devices./.

CONTROLS for PLAYER
[
    W moves PLAYER forward at 6 speed
    S moves PLAYER backward at 6 speed
    A moves PLAYER left at 6 speed
    D moves PLAYER right at 6 speed
    PLAYER can jump
    PLAYER can attack
    PLAYER can interact
    PLAYER can pause
].
